    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control: Keyboard arrow keys, A button = Z, B button = X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585430/extras/9ed7be78eea26fc91f94f282ca131d50.avif?t=1754217866\" width=1600 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no storyline\u2014just pure, strategic gameplay. This turn-based battle game centers around collecting and commanding unique card girls, each with their own abilities and charm. Assemble your ultimate team by collecting a wide variety of characters, then take on challenging stages using clever tactics and calculated moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory depends on how you organize your cards. Strategically assign them to your slots to unlock powerful synergies and dominate your enemies. Whether you're optimizing your team or experimenting with new combinations, every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Situational Card Girl selection adds depth to your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585430/extras/87ae72b1f194c8d803d4bcccf3bffec9.poster.avif?t=1754217866\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585430/extras/87ae72b1f194c8d803d4bcccf3bffec9.webm?t=1754217866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585430/extras/87ae72b1f194c8d803d4bcccf3bffec9.mp4?t=1754217866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfCritical hits have flashier effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585430/extras/8e2d74262b2e58acdc19a704a0b83531.poster.avif?t=1754217866\" width=1090 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585430/extras/8e2d74262b2e58acdc19a704a0b83531.webm?t=1754217866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585430/extras/8e2d74262b2e58acdc19a704a0b83531.mp4?t=1754217866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
